  outline-derived names, and is governed by NOTICE.md.

WHY THIS IS ADAPTED MATERIAL

Individual discipline names are not copyrightable. The protected element is the
selection and hierarchical arrangement of the outline, and the addresses in these
files encode that arrangement directly. An address paired with its name is
therefore adapted material and carries the ShareAlike obligation.

The numbering *scheme* is original work and is licensed separately — see
LICENSE-CONTENT. The scheme is not encumbered by this licence; only its
application to this particular outline is.

